{"text": "Then a low, dull, quick sound reached my ears, like a watch wrapped in cotton. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I knew that sound too, it was the beating of the old mans heart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It grew quicker and quicker, and louder and louder every moment. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old mans terror must have been extreme. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A new fear seized me, the sound would be heard by a neighbor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a loud yell, I threw open the lantern and jumped into the room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He cried once, only once, and then the room was silent. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old man was dead, and his eye would trouble me no more. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Next, I worked quickly but silently to hide the body. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I took up three boards from the floor and placed him under them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I put the boards back so cleverly that no human eye could have found anything wrong.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "w", ",", " ", "d", "u", "l", "l", ",", " ", "q", "u", "i", "c", "k", " ", "s", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "r", "e", "a", "c", "h", "e", "d", " ", "m", "y", " ", "e", "a", "r", "s", ",", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "w", "a", "t", "c", "h", " ", "w", "r", "a", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "c", "o", "t", "t", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "k", "n", "e", "w", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "s", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "t", "o", "o", ",", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "a", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "m", "a", "n", "s", " ", "h", "e", "a", "r", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "g", "r", "e", "w", " ", "q", "u", "i", "c", "k", "